{"4382960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snackrifice", "steam_appid": 4382960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4983400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Master grows impatient, be damned to an ever evolving Purgatory to retrieve Imps so that he may snack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/7220f931943ad26f22fce0a1265d46eb.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From toxic flooded hallways to dark mysterious catacombs, Purgatory takes many forms. Progress through each to unlock the next while avoiding all sorts of dangerous creatures and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/55100c8e664402f3d2cbb668a690928f.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=194 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each venture out is more dangerous than the last as you are cursed from a pool of over 50+ wild and whacky effects. Fear not though, the choice of ailment is up to you… most of the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/7734657717e9b2eeb959719fae57cc1c.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/7734657717e9b2eeb959719fae57cc1c.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/7734657717e9b2eeb959719fae57cc1c.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/dfdb8e8681a0de914c7d1f1cd9d0a284.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=188 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimsly, the grumpy shopkeeper has reluctantly offered up a large collection of relics to aid you, for the right price of course. Collect Undercoins in Purgatory to barter for powerful items to strengthen each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/352456d245de8cf3559f9044d02f66a4.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/352456d245de8cf3559f9044d02f66a4.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/352456d245de8cf3559f9044d02f66a4.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/01f1ceb44cbdbc8b15d250ca083ec1a1.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=195 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you have what it takes to brave Purgatory on your own? Neither do we! Which is why it's best to go with a group. Jump in with up to 3 friends and experience unique team-based challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/e86f1223adb8e58228146f649e7e7f73.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/e86f1223adb8e58228146f649e7e7f73.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/e86f1223adb8e58228146f649e7e7f73.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/ac0765a39ffe12d0bb402ad0ec295435.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=153 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic roguelike gameplay with procedural dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with up to 4 players along with proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge collection of curses, items and Purgatories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full character customization system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global and friend leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/56a678d120bc2320714702112ebe5827.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/56a678d120bc2320714702112ebe5827.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/56a678d120bc2320714702112ebe5827.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Master grows impatient, be damned to an ever evolving Purgatory to retrieve Imps so that he may snack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/7220f931943ad26f22fce0a1265d46eb.avif?t=1788181834\" width=646 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From toxic flooded hallways to dark mysterious catacombs, Purgatory takes many forms. Progress through each to unlock the next while avoiding all sorts of dangerous creatures and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.poster.avif?t=1788181834\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.webm?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382960/extras/cd4738f58e50d1a48a79d73ec77328ee.mp4?t=1788181834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>